OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FOutbreaks of rain affect parts
OL,6,Fof Scotland and northern England at
OL,7,Ffirst. A band of heavy, showery rain
OL,8,Fthen spreads eastwards, with blustery
OL,9,Fshowers and thunderstorms developing
OL,10,Fmore widely during the afternoon.
OL,11,FSoutheast England stays mostly dry.
OL,12,FBlustery at times.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FBands of heavy showers with a
OL,15,Frisk of hail and thunder move
OL,16,Fnortheastwards. Many areas becoming
OL,17,Fdry by dawn, although some showers
OL,18,Flinger in the west. Temperatures
OL,19,Fremaining above average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
