OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FA cloudy start with outbreaks
OL,6,Fof rain and showers, this heaviest
OL,7,Facross the north, with a risk of
OL,8,Fthunder. Turning drier and brighter
OL,9,Fthrough the afternoon. Breezy. Average
OL,10,Ftemperatures.
